summary:
  A quiet station waiting for its next knock offers nothing to stop.

history:
  The footer says Reconnecting and the big button has flipped to Play, so
  without this term there is no way to call off the ladder — the half of
  issue #13 the knock budget never covered.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      var held = audible || (wantsPlaying === true) || (tsPaused === true) || (tsShifted === true);

replace:
      var held = audible || (false) || (tsPaused === true) || (tsShifted === true);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_the_wait_between_two_knocks_offers_a_stop.
  Line-neutral.
